    "body": "> ![HTML Standard](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/72914115/311492951-49f470ae-05d6-41b5-a1fd-ec4385b67c91.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..sYQQ76I4MBA5ZSYmKtOHNU2LUWHb_PIK-7sVcI6NxmY)\r\n> \r\n> are you talking about this nav?\r\n\r\nI am talking about any navigators that will switch the page's dominant content, including the one you posted.\r\nGenerally speaking, navigators dont' have to have links. Buttons, checkboxes and many other widgets can also be used to switch the page's dominant content.",
