    "created_at": "2024-03-11T06:25:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-11T06:27:29Z",
    "body": "> While we're talking about this, I'd like to extend the semantics of the `main` element to help identify the difference between appetizers, entrées, dinner, dessert, and beverages on restaurant websites.\r\n\r\nTo be clarified:\r\nI had planned to create a SPA without even one single `<a>` element and provide `<a>` only in my static archives. And honestly I had been thinking of it a totally typical thing many SPAs do, until @scottaohara explained to me that that's not a thing a SPA typically does.",
